<title>AUSTRIA: Radex unit wins 100 mln ats Indian order.</title>
<headline>Radex unit wins 100 mln ats Indian order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian fireproof materials manufacturer Veitsch-Radex, a unit of Radex-Heraklith Industriebeteiligungs AG, said on Friday it had won a 100 million schilling order from India's Ispat Metallics.</p>
<p>The order, placed with Veitsch-Radex engineering subsidiary Didier M&amp;P Energietechnik GmbH, is for the delivery of furnace equipment.</p>
<p>In a statement, Veitsch-Radex said there was a good chance of further orders with Ispat.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
